The dish looks like a folded omelette on a plate roughly 22-26 cm across. The plate spans about 400 px, so at 24 cm that is about 0.06 cm per px. The omelette is roughly 290 px long (about 17 cm) and 120 px wide (about 7 cm). Folded, it is probably 2-3 cm thick.

That gives a volume of about 17 × 7 × 2.5 × 0.6, or roughly 180 cm³, which suggests about 150 g. An omelette made from 2-3 eggs with some oil weighs about 130-170 g. At roughly 1.5 kcal/g, that comes to about 220 kcal.

